                            "description": {
                              "value": "One ability score of your choice increases by 1. When you adopt a new morph, this score is reduced by 1. Instead of choosing a new morph, you can choose to make the acolyte morph your permanent form, which you can do at any time. If you make the acolyte morph permanent, you can choose one ability score to increase by 2."
