                            "description": {
                              "value": "You have natural chitinous armor. You have disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks. While unarmored, your AC is equal to 13 + your Constitution modifier. Even while wearing armor, you can use this natural armor to determine your AC if the armor you are wearing would leave you with a lower AC. You are still subject to the effects of the armor you are wearing if you do this."
                            },
                            "id": "14acd55f-e709-47b4-a771-589127939bcb",
