                            "description": {
                              "value": "Your ability to move freely while airborne grants you the effects of a natural armor equal to 12 + your Dexterity modifier. You can use this in place of your normal armor while airborne, if this would grant you a higher AC. You are still subject to the effects of the armor you are wearing when you do this."
